{"lines":[{"id":"s1","text":"Pay first,|and the points are gone."},{"id":"s2","text":"All froze.|Wrong move."},{"id":"s3","text":"One question|comes first."},{"id":"s4","text":"Same hands.|Card first."},{"id":"s5","text":"Show the card.|Then pay."},{"id":"s6","text":"She asked—"},{"id":"s7","text":"She scans it.|We just wait."},{"id":"s8","text":"Points added.|Change back."},{"id":"s9","text":"Card first.|That's the rule."},{"id":"n1","text":"The question comes|before the money."},{"id":"n2","text":"Show the card first.|Then you pay."},{"id":"n3","text":"Miss it once,|the points are gone."},{"id":"n4","text":"That's Japan first times.|Follow for more."}],"rate":"+8%","voice":"en-US-GuyNeural"}